# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The widgets page and the App Library in turn, with sb_cube/sb_debug over them (11-10: the pages with backdrop blurs,
# where frames still came half drawn): the widgets page 25 s, back, the App Library 25 s scrolled now and then, back;
# cputop beside it. RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.pages.
/redwood/bin/cputop 10 &
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 45 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 25 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 2 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 8 swipe 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.3 300 wait 5 swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.8 300 wait 10
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 2 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 60
